# Dependency Boundaries

Forbidden in `@dndgem/core` imports:

- `packages/dom`, `packages/react`
- browser APIs as dependencies of core logic
- React / react-dom
- dnd-kit
- AI provider SDKs

`@dndgem/dom` may depend on `@dnd-kit/dom` internally. `@dndgem/react` must not.

Consumers (apps/examples) must import `@dndgem/*` public exports only — never `src/internal` paths or relative package source trees.

Run `pnpm check:boundaries` after dependency changes.
